{"Title":"An Act relative to certain manufactured chemicals known as PFAS","BillNumber":"H3580","DocketNumber":"HD3308","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"RME1","Name":"Rodney M. Elliott","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RME1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T17:11:19.3"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"RME1","Name":"Rodney M. Elliott","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RME1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T17:11:19.3"},{"Id":"EDJ0","Name":"Edward J. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-21T15:00:21.12"},{"Id":"MRS1","Name":"Margaret R. Scarsdale","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MRS1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-05T10:57:09.2566667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3580/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Elliott of Lowell, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3580) of Rodney M. Elliott relative to certain manufactured chemicals known as PFAS.  Environment and Natural Resources.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 21C of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting after section 6 the following section:-\r\n\tSection 6A. The department shall establish such regulations concerning the collection, storage, treatment, use or disposal of per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances as it deems necessary to protect public health, safety and welfare and the environment.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 6 of chapter 29C of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding the following subsection:-\r\n\t(i) The board shall apply and disburse monies to any public water system, as defined in 310 CMR 22.02, that reports a per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances contaminant level exceeding the maximum contaminant level established in 310 CMR 22.07G.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J21","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J21"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}